WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:06.025
Setting up a SuiteLeaf account takes less than a minute, and your existing local files stay safe on your device.

2
00:00:05.975 --> 00:00:10.013
From your workspace home screen, click Connect to a server in the sidebar.

3
00:00:10.013 --> 00:00:15.987
Enter the address of your team's SuiteLeaf server—you don't even need to type https—and click Connect.

4
00:00:15.987 --> 00:00:18.824
SuiteLeaf opens the sign-in screen for that server.

5
00:00:18.824 --> 00:00:24.088
Click Create an account, enter your name, email address, and password, and submit.

6
00:00:24.088 --> 00:00:33.824
You land right in your team workspace with SuiteDrive ready for shared documents, spreadsheets, and presentations, while everything on your computer remains untouched whenever you disconnect.

